{"ID":"20240118145005-92pwvfu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145005-92pwvfu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145005-92pwvfu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145005-5eieohq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163800-njr3rjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163800-njr3rjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:44,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"354腐婢","type":"doc","updated":"20240124115914"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145005-5eieohq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145005-5eieohq","updated":"20240122163753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】小豆花也。味辛，平，无毒。治痎疟，寒热，邪气，泄利，阴不起，病酒头痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163754-qo74s9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163754-qo74s9p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治心中懊恼，旁治心中结痛及心中满而烦也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163757-wt46phg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163757-wt46phg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】不定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163759-iu7es42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163759-iu7es42"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163753-y398ka0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163753-y398ka0"}},{"ID":"20240122163800-jebktvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163800-jebktvj"}},{"ID":"20240122163800-njr3rjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163800-njr3rjp","updated":"20240122163804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在很少用了，治心中懊恼，心满而烦后面有豆豉给大家介绍。张仲景用栀子豉汤治虚烦不得眠。"}]}]}